(CHAPTER 5: EIGENVALUES AND EIGENVECTORS) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 728 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 50 712 Tm
(5.1 Definitions) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 696 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 50 680 Tm
(For an n x n matrix A, a scalar lambda is an eigenvalue) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 664 Tm
(and a nonzero vector v is a corresponding eigenvector if:) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 648 Tm
(  Av = lambda * v) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 632 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 50 616 Tm
(Finding Eigenvalues:) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 600 Tm
(  Solve the characteristic equation: det\(A - lambda*I\) = 0) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 584 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 50 568 Tm
(Example:) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 552 Tm
(  A = | 4  1 |) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 536 Tm
(      | 2  3 |) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 520 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 50 504 Tm
(  det\(A - lambda*I\) = \(4-lambda\)\(3-lambda\) - 2*1) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 488 Tm
(    = lambda^2 - 7*lambda + 10 = \(lambda-5\)\(lambda-2\) = 0) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 472 Tm
(  Eigenvalues: lambda1 = 5, lambda2 = 2) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 456 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 50 440 Tm
(Finding Eigenvectors:) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 424 Tm
(  For each eigenvalue, solve \(A - lambda*I\)v = 0) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 408 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 50 392 Tm
(  For lambda = 5: \(A - 5I\)v = 0) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 376 Tm
(    |-1  1 | |v1|   |0|) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 360 Tm
(    | 2 -2 | |v2| = |0|) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 344 Tm
(    v1 = v2, so v = t\(1,1\) for any nonzero t) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 328 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 50 312 Tm
(  For lambda = 2: \(A - 2I\)v = 0) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 296 Tm
(    | 2  1 | |v1|   |0|) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 280 Tm
(    | 2  1 | |v2| = |0|) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 264 Tm
(    v2 = -2*v1, so v = t\(1,-2\) for any nonzero t) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 248 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 50 232 Tm
(5.2 Diagonalization) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 216 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 50 200 Tm
(A matrix A is diagonalizable if it can be written as:) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 184 Tm
(  A = PDP^\(-1\)) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 168 Tm
(where D is a diagonal matrix of eigenvalues and P is a) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 152 Tm
(matrix whose columns are the corresponding eigenvectors.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 136 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 50 120 Tm
(A is diagonalizable if and only if it has n linearly) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 104 Tm
(independent eigenvectors.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 88 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 50 72 Tm
(Applications:) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 56 Tm
(  - Computing matrix powers: A^k = P * D^k * P^\(-1\)) Tj
